<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ExternalRefType/cwe> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "[Common Weakness Enumeration](https://csrc.nist.gov/glossary/term/common_weakness_enumeration). A reference to a source of software flaw defined within the official [CWE List](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/) that conforms to the [CWE specification](https://cwe.mitre.org/)."@en .
